### GET current IP configuration
GET http://{{host}}/api/ipconfig
Accept: application/json

### POST static IP (reboot may be required by device policy)
POST http://{{host}}/api/ipconfig
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dhcp": false,
  "ip": "192.168.1.50",
  "netmask": "255.255.255.0",
  "gateway": "192.168.1.1",
  "dns1": "8.8.8.8",
  "dns2": "8.8.4.4",
  "hostname": "KC868-A16-EnIP"
}

### POST DHCP
POST http://{{host}}/api/ipconfig
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dhcp": true,
  "hostname": "KC868-A16-EnIP"
}
